<title>MALAYSIA: MALAYSIA PPB OIL PALMS DEBUTS AT 2.98 RGT.</title>
<headline>MALAYSIA PPB OIL PALMS DEBUTS AT 2.98 RGT.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of PPB Oil Palms Bhd made their debut on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange at 2.98 ringgit each against an offer price of 2.80 ringgit.</p>
<p>The company had made an offer of 55.936 million shares as part of its listing exercise.  </p>
<p>PPB Oil has forecast a net profit of 84.31 million ringgit for calender 1997 against 72.08 million last year.</p>
<p>At the debut price of 2.98 ringgit, the share is trading at a price-to-earnings ratio of 10.5 times against 9.87 at the offer price.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom 603-201 4813; Fax-603-232 6752</p>
<p>-- kuala.lumpur.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
